{"type":"message","id":"f1e89fd6","parentId":"6a82bbd3","timestamp":"2026-03-31T17:20:26.925Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering response options**\n\nI need to respond in a concise way, and maybe I should include the media link? The user mentioned they prefer the message tool, but it’s not available right now. I think using the inline link might be a good alternative, and it seems like that should be okay. I'll make sure to keep my response straightforward and user-friendly, providing what they need without any extra fluff!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_05d0a16eaf1e343f0169cc02546e1881919c6b15cdffe6ef2f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpzAJWLVMjL-yy4cDj96BWuflmf04UdL_xYrZVBKEBadm5-AVO_-LE1XCbYbHOCbjsgMbd3e2hbPRwr2QtGfPJEs4AW_EBwxNOd-f9cJ41KGwQabCYgov3sDcDiKJIw1Ri1RXUduX7zuGTbciKMFoRURKXXHxRI-vZLc1vX_N1beDT0A1rkW5GpQPMojJiXs7o7N_axjio-p14uJx6vzmd7TirrigOUIPcmieTFKyq5yOVflj9uxlz6IGgbpi8q_UcLRe7M_Y1MoHYILIU4pVweC6PkAHU4F3aEPkeO8CgUdSFC4vyjGtxg5wcsgugT4j1hqAPA5qAEYOfdvVNT0JZ3Us1NlU8L4RU_PyNxepN7HbgZiENQBxkC53JA_n0DM9AKRrVu0gO7lu24UDKkqydOhEXrlPaZ9zpsIrWjXCddyer64kTsuTnLP74zdiR7HG89uNH1y-JrnEAKiyTOW673aj5FQQvgm8PbvesyurRaiZK5ko6pkf56laWBat75aWsPYnW44Z4PaEy4g8mgO1QFhEfKiojNul0rZRHZUaCHzRcEqgippSHbiEf8Uo-GUQuD3c2n9V5CduBxcEfh_qS-aykXMvjVDq9LywSJrUbUIXwLcTkIXXB019EhkXCjohFtvhZbd6CgmuhiKEJBvzDpv9uW3poTRSIyk23iXrNc7LosKXlIaBB8y4q7uuF2Ag4JVNOoUYcuMN8zG3XxjiETX1dA2r8AiLQeeChwRgHCzwEx8GmtiyYSQ2eg6WipUjDvc9Ztx4Mxf7DIFeiY2EOawtl6xWuyLrG-snc6idD1cVcE39WjC0xbJ1GKIkwow4Q29yr8ZnBQDO7_hR9YmAYTY7LkctJ1RnXsAv3Z0ImxplRMOjaSp1T6fd0hPZSawKfT3qTNvlgR_fya547fDy3zDRwDHZuSZWSaYLl-d6DurpuEfJb0FHDa8zWyOurNZgkl6PryJDCpgFLrZACdnIk7G6Q5wdGJB6sY-B1fekoxdIUB5A=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering response options**\\n\\nI need to respond in a concise way, and maybe I should include the media link? The user mentioned they prefer the message tool, but it’s not available right now. I think using the inline link might be a good alternative, and it seems like that should be okay. I'll make sure to keep my response straightforward and user-friendly, providing what they need without any extra fluff!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I ran the skin cancer pipeline on your image.\n\n**Skin Cancer Detector**\n- Class: **Benign nevus**\n- Confidence: **0.9984**\n- Inference time: **2.37 s**\n\n**Image Analyzer**\n- Prediction: **nv**\n- CAM coverage: **0.1199**\n- CAM center ratio: **0.9229**\n- CAM left-right asymmetry: **0.5957**\n- CAM top-bottom asymmetry: **0.1383**\n- CAM explanation: the model focused on patterns it described as asymmetry with central structural homogeneity.\n\n**X-AI summary**\n- Summary: the image was classified as a **benign nevus** with high confidence.\n- Visual evidence: it described regular borders and homogeneous color as features supporting that result.\n- Suggested next steps: clinical exam, and biopsy only if the diagnosis is uncertain or the lesion is changing.\n\nThis is a **preliminary signal, not a diagnosis**. If this spot is new, changing, bleeding, irregular, or worrying you, a dermatologist should review it.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69be3b4593ce5ab1f19b2cfb/b110f42e-7d7f-48f1-91d8-5a488ba67413.jpg\n\nIf you want, I can also give you the **raw JSON output** or a **short medical-style interpretation** of this result.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05d0a16eaf1e343f0169cc025679588191a6c95b5648509da0\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":81828,"output":368,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82196,"cost":{"input":0.20457000000000003,"output":0.00552,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.21009000000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774977616708}}
